ce."}, "name": "send_message", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0125KeqYEMsPCUJoANPC3NoP", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"user_id": "7004", "text": "Hi, unfortunately your flight AL900 (SEA\u2192BOS, 9/20) was cancelled by the airline. Per your request not to be rebooked, we've cancelled your reservation free of charge and a refund will be processed. We apologize for the inconvenience."}, "name": "send_message", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}], "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1731, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3513, "output_tokens": 871, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "server_tool_use": null, "service_tier": "standard"}, "tool_results": [{"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01B832s19kAksni5E3wU5oLs", "content": "sent"}, {"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_018Lhxvv5yDLnh4NwPtv2iQr", "content": "sent"}, {"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01FrL3z5g2qukNYdY5nJay2C", "content": "sent"}, {"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_015rXe69aREWtb66mt8vc96R", "content": "sent"}, {"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_0125KeqYEMsPCUJoANPC3NoP", "content": "sent"}]}, {"assistant": [{"citations": null, "text": "All five reservations affected by the AL900 (SEA\u2192BOS, 9/20) cancellation have been handled per policy:\n\n- **R-3001 (Maya Cole, gold)** \u2192 rebooked on AL712 (dep 08:50, arr 17:40)\n- **R-3005 (Rosa Lind, gold)** \u2192 rebooked on AL712 (dep 08:50, arr 17:40) \u2014 gold members prioritized, and Maya's earlier booking time gave her priority over Rosa for the last seats\n- **R-3002 (Theo Park, silver)** \u2192 AL712 was full after gold priority seating, so rebooked on next-best option AL706 (dep 08:45, arr 17:10)\n- **R-3003 (basic economy)** \u2192 cancelled free of charge (basic economy cannot be rebooked)\n- **R-3004** \u2192 cancelled free of charge per passenger's note requesting no rebooking\n\nAll passengers have been notified.", "type": "text"}], "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1731, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4525, "output_tokens": 309, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "server_tool_use": null, "service_tier": "standard"}}], "trace_id": "01M2F50CRGFJNDP65G86DM3F7G", "agentlens": {"format": "agentlens/v1", "trace_id": "01M2F50CRGFJNDP65G86DM3F7G", "name": "episode:tools/air_stack_disruption", "started_at": "2026-09-14T05:07:31.216168Z", "ended_at": "2026-09-14T05:08:00.084317Z", "duration_ms": 28868.149, "status": "ok", "attributes": {"episode_id": "tools-air_stack_disruption-01M2F50CRGEN9WS2NH06JH2XYT", "family": "tools", "task_id": "air_stack_disruption", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "corpus": "agentlens-failure-corpus", "outcome": "pass"}, "cost_usd": 0.086798, "tokens": {"input": 11719, "output": 3235, "cache_read": 10386, "cache_write": 0}, "spans": [{"span_id": "01M2F50CRG2SCCY7B3WWRA294H", "trace_id": "01M2F50CRGFJNDP65G86DM3F7G", "parent_span_id": null, "name": "episode:tools/air_stack_disruption", "type": "agent", "status": "ok", "started_at": "2026-09-14T05:07:31.216190Z", "ended_at": "2026-09-14T05:08:00.084298Z", "duration_ms": 28868.108, "attributes": {"episode_id": "tools-air_stack_disruption-01M2F50CRGEN9WS2NH06JH2XYT", "family": "tools", "task_id": "air_stack_disruption", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "corpus": "agentlens-failure-corpus", "outcome": "pass"}, "input": {"system": "You are an airline service agent. The current time is 2026-09-06 08:00 UTC. Follow this policy exactly.\n- Never change or cancel a reservation you have not fetched with get_reservation first.\n- Basic economy reservations cannot be changed and cannot be upgraded. They may be cancelled only\n  within 24 hours of booking.\n- Never put a passenger on a flight that did not come back from search_flights.\n- Checked bags: gold members get one free checked bag; everyone else pays. Maximum 2 per passenger.\n- If the airline cancelled the flight, the passenger cancels free of charge (free=true).\n- When the policy forbids what was asked, do not do something else instead: explain with send_message.\n- Always finish by confirming to the passenger with send_message.\n- Booking timestamps are UTC. The 24-hour cancellation window runs from the booking timestamp, to the minute.\n- Never move a passenger onto a flight whose seats field is 0.\n- Flight departure and arrival times are local to the airport they refer to.\n- A disrupted passenger is rebooked onto the latest-departing flight on the same route and date that still\n  lands by 18:00 local time and has a seat, unless their reservation notes ask otherwise.\n- When seats run short, gold members are rebooked before everyone else; within the same group, the earliest\n  booking timestamp goes first.\n- Basic economy reservations cannot be changed, so a disrupted basic economy passenger is cancelled free of charge.\n- A passenger whose notes ask not to be rebooked is cancelled free of charge.", "prompt": "Flight AL900 from Seattle to Boston on 2026-09-20 has been cancelled. Handle every affected reservation according to the policy and tell each passenger what happened."}, "output": {"outcome": "pass"}, "tokens": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cache_read": 0, "cache_write": 0}, "cost_usd": 0.0}, {"span_id": "01M2F50CRGKSK326CBREN8GHKJ", "trace_id": "01M2F50CRGFJNDP65G86DM3F7G", "parent_span_id": "01M2F50CRG2SCCY7B3WWRA294H", "name": "turn 0", "type": "llm", "status": "ok", "started_at": "2026-09-14T05:07:31.216252Z", "ended_at": "2026-09-14T05:07:32.782592Z", "duration_ms": 1566.34, "attributes": {"turn": 0, "stop_reason": "tool_use"}, "input": null, "output": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_013SWmtfEPPRJt2e4qTfQ5E3", "caller": {"ty